<!--Sap Launcher shots
  -Base: Halfways stats of glowsap. No damage. Basically normal sap.
  -Glowsap: basically glue, slows down the target the most, but has next to no damage.
  -Brightsap: applies a hediff that improves vision, then decreases it. Deals next to no damage.
  -Endosap: hits the target like a rock and has a burst of slowness, but is quick to wear off.
  -Hypersap: Acidic, and will cause burns over time.
  -Toxsap: Poisons the target, causing standard toxic effects.
  -Deepsap: Causes the target to gain Bloompox, rooting them and causing their body to release various seeds. Lethal if untreated.
  -Sunsap: Burns the target, causes immediate burns. Very high damage.
  -Starsap: Same as sunsap.
  -Archsap: Todo. Likely a lethal, transformative effect.
-->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseBullet">
    <defName>ET_SapShot_Base</defName>
    <label>glowsap globule</label>
